  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added a dynamic cron scheduler (AddBackgroundJobs / IJobScheduler) with add, reschedule and remove at runtime, per-job DI scope, and a pluggable IScheduleStore for durable schedules. The scheduler ticks in-memory and never polls the store. Fully backwards compatible: the existing queue API is unchanged. Also hardened graceful shutdown so in-flight queue tasks drain instead of being abandoned. Now multi-targets net6.0 and net8.0.",
